OL,3,GNEWSANew police roles to tackle
OL,4,Aviolence against women
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a dozen new police roles will
OL,7,Fbe created to tackle violence against
OL,8,Fwomen and girls, Jersey ministers have
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FMinister for Justice and Home Affairs
OL,12,FSenator Helen Miles confirmed the new
OL,13,Froles in response to a question from
OL,14,Fdeputy Samantha Gleave who asked how
OL,15,F#5m allocated in the budget to tackling
OL,16,Fthe issue would be spent.
OL,18,FMiles said the new roles were designed
OL,19,Fto increase capacity "within the system
OL,20,Fto meet current demand".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
