OL,3,GNEWSANew police roles to tackle
OL,4,Aviolence against women
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the funding would also go
OL,7,Ftowards a number of other departments,
OL,8,Fincluding Justice and Home Affairs, to
OL,9,Fhelp introduce new laws protecting
OL,10,Fwomen.
